BASED ON
--------
Lumora is a modified version of the open-source project "Scrolless":
  Scrolless - Copyright (C) 2026 Scrolless authors (Anish, "Xeven777")
  https://github.com/Xeven777/Scrolless
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0.

Scrolless was itself inspired by:
  https://github.com/duartebarbosadev/scrolless

The original copyright notices are kept in the headers of the source files, as the GPL
requires. Changes made in Lumora include: a new name, logo and visual design; the
accessibility-off alert and keep-alive service; blocking schedule; strict pause; stopped-today
counter; settings backup and restore; the optional On-demand mode that switches the accessibility
service on and off with the app in front; a smaller list of supported apps; removal of all network access.

